- Found a real test-methodology gotcha along the way: a default-layout (moov-at-end) MP4 reliably fails the progressive probe when chunks arrive all at once (e.g. rapid curl requests on localhost) — correct, safe backend behavior, but means curl-based testing of the progressive path needs a `+faststart` source file to reliably exercise it.
