**1. Content Rating System Implemented (8 Ratings)** ✅
- ✅ **Post Content Ratings Added**: G, PG, Educational, Religious, 13+, 16+, 18+, Mature
- ✅ **Age Verification Enhanced**: `User.CanViewContent()` checks DOB against rating requirements
- ✅ **Recording Options Modal Updated**: Added allowDownloads checkbox + contentRating dropdown
- ✅ **Database Migration Created**: `20260510_add_content_rating_to_posts.sql` (ready to run)
- ✅ **Educational/Religious Fix**: Users without DOB can access G, PG, Educational, Religious content
- ✅ **All Ages Content**: G, PG, Educational, Religious available to everyone
- ✅ **Age-Restricted Content**: 13+, 16+, 18+, Mature require DOB verification

**Technical Implementation**:
```go
// User age verification logic
func (user *User) CanViewContent(contentRating string) bool {
    age := user.GetAge()
    if age == 0 {
        return contentRating == "G" || contentRating == "PG" || 
               contentRating == "Educational" || contentRating == "Religious"
    }
    
    switch contentRating {
    case "G", "PG", "Educational", "Religious":
        return true // All ages
    case "13+":
        return age >= 13
    case "16+":
        return age >= 16
    case "18+", "Mature":
        return age >= 18
    default:
        return true
    }
}
```

