1. User types in search box on "Watching Live" tab
2. Sessions instantly filter by: room name, host, rating, title, or watch type
3. Can search "18+" to find mature content, "classroom" for educational sessions, etc.
4. Empty state appears if no matches found

**Why This Matters:**
Previously, users with hundreds of live sessions had no way to filter by content rating or other criteria. Now they can quickly find age-appropriate content or specific session types without scrolling endlessly.

