## 🎯 LIVEKIT INFRASTRUCTURE STRATEGY: WHY SELF-HOSTING IS YOUR COMPETITIVE ADVANTAGE

### ✅ Current Setup Confirmed (May 8, 2026)

**What You Have:**
- **Self-hosted LiveKit server** running via Docker (`livekit/livekit-server:latest`)
- Configuration: `livekit.yaml` (port 7880, WebRTC ports 50000-50100)
- Backend integration: `backend/internal/utils/livekit.go`
