## 🔍 SEO & DISCOVERABILITY (CRITICAL GAP ⚠️)

### **Current State: POOR SEO (2/10)**

**Problems:**
1. ❌ **No meta tags** - Missing title, description, keywords
2. ❌ **No Open Graph tags** - Poor social media sharing (no previews on Twitter/Facebook)
3. ❌ **No robots.txt** - Search engines don't know what to crawl
4. ❌ **No sitemap.xml** - Google can't discover pages
5. ❌ **SPA with no SSR** - JavaScript-only content (Google can crawl, but slower indexing)
6. ❌ **Generic page title** - "Vite + React" instead of "WeWatch - Social Streaming Platform"
7. ❌ **No Schema.org markup** - No rich snippets in search results
8. ❌ **No canonical URLs** - Duplicate content issues

**Impact:**
- Won't rank on Google for "watch party app Nigeria" or similar searches
- Social media shares show generic preview (no thumbnail, title, or description)
- Can't compete with established apps in organic search
- Users must find you through direct links or social media posts only

### **SEO Improvement Plan (Post-Launch Priority):**

**Phase 1: Basic SEO (1-2 days work):**
1. Add proper meta tags to `index.html`:
   ```html
   <title>WeWatch - Social Streaming Platform | Watch Together, Stream Live</title>
   <meta name="description" content="Join WeWatch to host watch parties, stream live content, and connect with communities in Nigeria. LiveShare, podcasts, church streaming, and more.">
   <meta name="keywords" content="watch party, Nigeria streaming, live share, church streaming, podcast platform">
   ```

2. Add Open Graph tags (for social sharing):
   ```html
   <meta property="og:title" content="WeWatch - Watch Together, Stream Live">
   <meta property="og:description" content="Host watch parties, stream live, connect with communities">
   <meta property="og:image" content="https://wewatch.ng/og-image.jpg">
   <meta property="og:url" content="https://wewatch.ng">
   <meta property="og:type" content="website">
   ```

3. Add Twitter Card tags:
   ```html
   <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
   <meta name="twitter:title" content="WeWatch - Social Streaming Platform">
   <meta name="twitter:description" content="Watch together, stream live content">
   <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://wewatch.ng/twitter-card.jpg">
   ```

4. Create `robots.txt` in `public/` folder:
   ```
   User-agent: *
   Allow: /
   Disallow: /admin/
   Sitemap: https://wewatch.ng/sitemap.xml
   ```

5. Generate `sitemap.xml` (list all public pages)

**Phase 2: Advanced SEO (Post-traction):**
1. Server-Side Rendering (SSR) with Next.js or similar
2. Schema.org markup for VideoObject, Event, Organization
3. Dynamic meta tags per page (room pages, session pages)
4. Blog for content marketing (SEO magnet)
5. Backlink strategy (Nigerian tech blogs, press releases)

**Expected SEO Timeline:**
- Month 1-3: Almost zero organic traffic (new domain, no backlinks)
- Month 4-6: Start ranking for long-tail keywords ("church live streaming Nigeria")
- Month 7-12: Rank for competitive terms if you build backlinks and content

**SEO Reality:** You'll get 95% of early users from:
- Direct links (sharing sessions)
- Social media posts (Twitter, Instagram, WhatsApp groups)
- Word of mouth (church communities, universities)
- Paid ads (if budget allows)

SEO is a **long-term play** - don't expect it to drive launch traffic.

