- `frontend/src/components/SessionPreview.jsx` - Disabled autoplay when flag is true
- `frontend/src/hooks/useLiveKitRoom.js` - Cap quality at 480p for data saver
- `frontend/src/components/LobbyPage.jsx` - Added header badge indicator

