- Test in CinemaScene3DDemo (3D cinema)
- Test in LectureHallPage (classroom) - if applicable
- Verify graphics layer over video correctly on all types

**Expected Benefits:**

1. **Better Quality:**
   - Host video: 720p-1080p (compressed by LiveKit)
   - Graphics: Vector/text rendered crisp at native resolution
   - No compression artifacts on ticker/banner text

2. **Lower Bandwidth:**
   - Without transmission: Host sends 2-4 Mbps video (graphics baked in)
   - With transmission: Host sends 1-3 Mbps video + 0.001 Mbps WebSocket
   - Saves 25-33% bandwidth per viewer

3. **Dynamic Updates:**
   - Ticker updates → Instant on all devices (no video lag)
   - Banner changes → Immediate sync
   - Lower third edits → Real-time propagation

4. **Accessibility:**
   - Screen readers can read transmitted text
   - Font sizes adjustable per viewer
   - High contrast mode possible for vision impaired

