✅ No visual difference between host and member rendering  
✅ Bandwidth usage: <0.01 Mbps for graphics transmission  
✅ Works across all 3 watch types (VideoWatch, 3D Cinema, Lecture Hall)  
✅ Zero rendering errors in console  

