## Project Identity
- **Name**: LetsWatchOut (previously WeWatch in code)
- **Domain**: letswatchout.com (available)
- **Type**: Social streaming platform with 3D cinema rooms
- **Stage**: Beta (8 users, ~1000 sessions, ₦2000 revenue, 100% positive feedback)
- **Launch Target**: April 30, 2026 (PWA + Play Store)

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: React + Vite + TailwindCSS
- **Backend**: Go (Gin framework)
- **Database**: PostgreSQL
- **Real-time**: WebSocket + LiveKit (audio/video)
- **Authentication**: JWT (HttpOnly cookies) + Google OAuth 2.0
- **Hosting**: Backend on localhost:8080, Frontend on localhost:5173
- **Environment**: WSL Ubuntu 22.04

