## Session Preview Real-time Updates (April 13, 2026) ✅

### Problem Statement
**Issue 1:** Session preview cards stuck on emoji icon after media upload (required manual refresh)
**Issue 2:** Session end showed "generating preview" spinner instead of smooth removal

### Root Causes Identified
1. **Poster generation** (chunk_upload.go) was async but didn't broadcast to lobby
2. **Empty preview URLs** interpreted as "generating" instead of "clearing"
3. **session_ended broadcast** only included room_id, not session_id (prevented optimistic removal)

### Solution Implemented (5-Part Fix)

#### 1. Backend: Poster Broadcast After Upload
**File:** backend/internal/handlers/chunk_upload.go (lines 203-232)
**Change:** Added lobby broadcast in poster generation goroutine
```go
// After poster generated → Broadcast to lobby
hub := GetWebSocketManager()
if hub != nil {
    notification := map[string]interface{}{
        "type":       "session_preview_updated",
        "session_id": sessionID,
        "poster_url": posterPath,
        "preview_url": "", // MP4 not ready yet
    }
    data, _ := json.Marshal(notification)
    hub.BroadcastToLobby(OutgoingMessage{Data: data, IsBinary: false})
}
```

#### 2. Backend: Session ID in Ended Broadcast  
**File:** backend/internal/handlers/rooms.go (lines 747-759)
**Change:** Added session_id to lobby broadcast payload
```go
// EndWatchSessionHandler - Added session_id for optimistic removal
hub.BroadcastToLobby(OutgoingMessage{
    Data: json.Marshal(map[string]interface{}{
        "type":       "session_ended",
        "room_id":    roomID,
        "session_id": sessionID, // ✅ NEW - enables optimistic removal
    }),
})
```

#### 3. Frontend: isClearing State in SessionPreview
**File:** frontend/src/components/SessionPreview.jsx (lines 6-31)
**Change:** Added isClearing prop to differentiate clearing vs generating
```jsx
// SessionPreview - Added isClearing state
const SessionPreview = ({ session, previewUrl, posterUrl, isGenerating, isClearing = false, muted = true }) => {
  useEffect(() => {
    if (isClearing) {
      // ✅ Session ended → Go to emoji immediately (no spinner)
      setLoadState('emoji');
      return;
    }
    if (isGenerating) {
      setLoadState('loading'); // Show spinner
      return;
    }
    // Cascade: previewUrl → posterUrl → emoji
  }, [previewUrl, posterUrl, isGenerating, isClearing]);
}
```

#### 4. Frontend: Optimistic Session Removal
**File:** frontend/src/components/LobbyPage.jsx (lines 1625-1660)
**Change:** Remove session immediately on session_ended (no API call)
```jsx
case 'session_ended':
  if (message.session_id) {
    // Remove from all state objects immediately
    setSessions(prev => prev.filter(s => s.session_id !== message.session_id));
    setSessionsPage(prev => ({
      ...prev,
      data: prev.data.filter(s => s.session_id !== message.session_id)
    }));
    setSessionPreviews(prev => {
      const updated = { ...prev };
      delete updated[message.session_id];
      return updated;
    });
    // Clear likes and chat counts
  }
  break;
```

#### 5. Frontend: Enhanced Preview Update Handler
**File:** frontend/src/components/LobbyPage.jsx (lines 1706-1748)
**Change:** Handle poster-only, full preview, and clearing scenarios
```jsx
case 'session_preview_updated':
  if (!message.poster_url && !message.preview_url) {
    // Empty URLs = Clearing preview (media switched)
    setSessionPreviews(prev => ({
      ...prev,
      [message.session_id]: {
        posterUrl: null,
        previewUrl: null,
        isGenerating: true,
        isClearing: false,
      }
    }));
  } else if (message.poster_url && !message.preview_url) {
    // ✅ Poster only (MP4 not ready) → Show poster immediately
    setSessionPreviews(prev => ({
      ...prev,
      [message.session_id]: {
        posterUrl: message.poster_url,
        previewUrl: null,
        isGenerating: false, // Show poster, not spinner
        isClearing: false,
      }
    }));
  } else {
    // Full preview ready (poster + MP4)
    setSessionPreviews(prev => ({
      ...prev,
      [message.session_id]: {
        posterUrl: message.poster_url,
        previewUrl: message.preview_url,
        isGenerating: false,
        isClearing: false,
      }
    }));
  }
  break;
```

### Preview Cascade Flow
**Emoji → Poster → MP4 Video**

1. **Upload finishes** → Poster generated → Broadcast `{ session_id, poster_url }` → Card shows poster
2. **MP4 ready** → Broadcast `{ session_id, poster_url, preview_url }` → Card transitions to video
3. **Session ends** → Broadcast `{ session_id }` → Card removed from UI

### Files Modified
- backend/internal/handlers/chunk_upload.go (added lobby broadcast)
- backend/internal/handlers/rooms.go (added session_id to broadcast)
- frontend/src/components/SessionPreview.jsx (added isClearing prop)
- frontend/src/components/LobbyPage.jsx (optimistic removal + enhanced preview handler)

### Expected Behavior
- ✅ Upload media → Poster appears immediately (no refresh needed)
- ✅ MP4 ready → Smooth transition to video preview
- ✅ End session → Card disappears smoothly (no spinner)
- ✅ Real-time updates → All lobby users see changes instantly

