## 📍 UPDATES (May 19, 2026)

### Feature 1 — Report System ✅

Users can report rooms, posts, and users. Admins review reports in the dashboard.

**Backend** (`backend/internal/handlers/report_handler.go` — new file):
- `Report` model (inline in handler file): `reporter_id`, `target_type` (room/post/user), `target_id`, `reason`, `description`, `status` (pending/reviewed/dismissed), `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`
- UNIQUE(reporter_id, target_type, target_id) constraint — race-safe dedup via PG constraint + 409 on conflict
- Self-report guard: returns 400 if `target_type == "user" && target_id == currentUserID`
- `CreateReportHandler` — `POST /api/reports`
- `CheckReportedHandler` — `GET /api/reports/check?target_type=...&target_id=...`
- `GetAdminReportsHandler` — `GET /api/admin/reports?status=pending|reviewed|dismissed` — returns `{ reports, total, page, counts: { pending, reviewed, dismissed } }`
- `UpdateAdminReportHandler` — `PATCH /api/admin/reports/:id` — updates status field

**DB migration (run manually in psql):**
```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS reports (
  id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  reporter_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id),
  target_type VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
  target_id BIGINT NOT NULL,
  reason VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
  description TEXT,
  status VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending',
  reviewed_by BIGINT REFERENCES users(id),
  reviewed_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
  UNIQUE(reporter_id, target_type, target_id)
);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_reports_status ON reports (status);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_reports_target ON reports (target_type, target_id);
```

**Routes registered in `main.go`:**
```go
reportsGroup := r.Group("/api/reports")
reportsGroup.Use(handlers.AuthMiddleware())
reportsGroup.POST("", handlers.CreateReportHandler)
reportsGroup.GET("/check", handlers.CheckReportedHandler)
// adminGroup:
adminGroup.GET("/reports", handlers.GetAdminReportsHandler)
adminGroup.PATCH("/reports/:id", handlers.UpdateAdminReportHandler)
```

**Frontend:**
- `frontend/src/components/ReportModal.jsx` (new) — checks `/api/reports/check` on mount; shows already-reported state; 8 reason options; optional description; 409 response → sets alreadyReported state; props: `targetType`, `targetId`, `targetName`, `onClose`
- `frontend/src/components/DiscoverFeed.jsx` — Flag button (hidden on own posts) opens ReportModal for posts
- `frontend/src/components/LobbyPage.jsx` — non-host room ellipsis menu with "Report Room" option; separate `openRoomContextMenuId` state (avoids conflict with host's `openMenuRoomId`)
- `frontend/src/services/api.js` — `submitReport`, `checkReported` exports added
- `frontend/src/pages/AdminDashboard.jsx` — Reports section: pending badge count, status filter tabs, table (reporter, target type+id, reason, details, date), Reviewed/Dismiss action buttons

### Feature 2 — Post Tips ✅

Users can tip posts with 1 token (100 cents). Silent failure on zero balance. No self-tipping.

**Backend** (`backend/internal/handlers/posts.go` — `TipPost` handler):
- `POST /api/posts/:id/tip`
- 1 tip = 100 cents: deducted from tipper, 95 cents to creator, 5 cents to `platform_accounting.TokenDonationCommission` + `LifetimeTokenDonationCommission`
- Zero balance → returns 200 OK `{"message":"ok"}` silently (no error exposed to user)
- Self-tip guard: returns 400 if tipper == post owner
- Inserts `post_tips` row, increments `posts.tip_count` — all in a single DB transaction

**DB migration (run manually in psql):**
```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS post_tips (
  id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  tipper_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id),
  post_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES posts(id),
  amount_cents INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 100,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_post_tips_post_id ON post_tips (post_id);
ALTER TABLE posts ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS tip_count INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0;
```

**Frontend** (`frontend/src/components/DiscoverFeed.jsx`):
- Coin tip button (🪙) in engagement row, hidden on own posts
- Optimistic +1 on `postTips` local state; reverts on API error — no toast on failure (silent)
- `tipPost` API helper in `frontend/src/services/api.js`

### Feature 3 — Merged Post Tab in PostUploadModal ✅

"Text" and "Upload" tabs merged into a single "Post" tab.

**`frontend/src/components/PostUploadModal.jsx`:**
- Tab system changed from 3 tabs (Camera/Text/Upload) to 2 tabs (Camera/Post)
- `post` mode (merged): textarea at top, optional media drop zone below with X to remove
- If media present: media is main content, text becomes `description` field
- If no media: generates 1080×1080 canvas from text content (existing canvas logic preserved)
- "Continue →" button appears when text or file is present; auto-advances to step 2 when file selected
- `handleBack` clears `uploadFile`, `previewUrl`, `textContent` for post mode
- `resetStates` includes `setUploadError(null)`

### Feature 4 — Upload Retry UX ✅

On upload error: inline red error banner with Retry button instead of a toast; submit button hidden while error is shown.

**`frontend/src/components/PostUploadModal.jsx`:**
- Added `uploadError` state (string | null)
- On `handleSubmit` error: sets `uploadError` message, clears `uploading`/`progress` — does NOT toast
- Error banner with `AlertCircle` icon + message + inline "Retry" button that calls `setUploadError(null); handleSubmit()`
- Submit button hidden (`{!uploadError && <button>Post</button>}`) while error is shown
- `resetStates` clears `uploadError`

