## Updates (2026-05-23)

### RoomPageNew Header & Sidebar Layout
- `useMobile` hook threshold changed from `<= 768` to `< 1024` — mobile layout now applies to all non-desktop (phone + tablet).
- Header container padding: `px-0 md:px-3 lg:px-4` — full-bleed on phones only, padding restored on tablet and desktop.
- Dynamic header height: `headerRef` + `ResizeObserver` → `mobileHeaderHeight` state → inline `paddingTop` on both the chat messages area and `RoomPageLeftSidebar`. Default 80px until measured. Replaces the old hardcoded `pt-[248px]` which was stale.
- Chat column wrapped in `flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-0` inside the row after the sidebar — fixes desktop chat input bleeding under the sidebar.
- `RoomPageLeftSidebar` accepts `mobileHeaderHeight` prop; uses `paddingTop: ${mobileHeaderHeight + 8}px` inline on mobile.
- Desktop icon gap increased (`gap-6`), scheduleWatch + roomTV icons `h-11 w-11`. Mid-screen (`md:`) gap `md:gap-5`, begin-watch `md:h-[38px]`.

### Notifications System
**Backend — `handlers/notifications.go`**
- `CreateNotification(userID, type, title, body, entityType, entityID)` — inserts DB row + pushes `notification_new` WS event. Always call via `go CreateNotification(...)`.
- `UpsertDMNotification(recipientID, senderID, senderUsername, messagePreview)` — batches DM notifications: finds existing unread `dm_received` from same sender, increments count in title ("2 unread messages from @alice"), updates `created_at` to bubble it to top. Falls back to `CreateNotification` if none found.

**Notification types wired (where each fires → entityType/entityID):**
| Type | Handler | EntityType | EntityID |
|---|---|---|---|
| `room_post` | `posts.go` CreatePost | `room` | room ID |
| `session_started` | `rooms.go` StartWatchSession | `room` | room ID |
| `session_ended` | `rooms.go` background goroutine (non-instant, non-host members) | `room` | room ID |
| `post_like` | `posts.go` LikePost | `post` | post ID |
| `post_comment` | `posts.go` CreatePostComment (top-level only) | `post` | post ID |
| `reply` | `posts.go` CreatePostComment (replies only) | `post_comment` | parent comment ID |
| `event_booking_confirm` | `ticket_handlers.go` after commit | `session` | session ID |
| `event_booking` | `ticket_handlers.go` after commit → host | `session` | session ID |
| `token_gift` | `donation_handlers.go` GiftTokensHandler | `user` | donor ID |
| `dm_received` | `lobby_chats.go` SendLobbyChatMessageHandler (UPSERT) | `user` | sender ID |
| `missed_call` | `lobby_calls.go` logMissedCall | `user` | caller ID |
| `watch_invite` | `watch_out_handler.go` SendWatchOutHandler | `room` | room ID |

**Frontend — `LobbyPage.jsx`**
- WS pushes `notif_type` field; API returns `type` field — always read as `n.notif_type || n.type`.
- `handleNotificationClick(n)`: closes panel, marks read, routes:
  - Room/session types → `navigate('/rooms/:entity_id')`
  - Post types → switch to Watching Live tab
  - `dm_received`/`missed_call` → switch Chats tab + `handleOpenChat(friend)` if found in `friendsList`
  - `token_gift` → `navigate('/payment')`
- Notification panel rows changed from `<div>` to `<button>` with `onClick`.

### Calendar Badge
- `upcomingEventsCount` state added to LobbyPage; fetched on mount via `GET /api/user/upcoming-events`.
- Amber badge on taskbar `CalendarDaysIcon` when count > 0 (matches bell badge style).
- Badge cleared (`setUpcomingEventsCount(0)`) when drawer opens.


